makepasswd-khorben (generate pseudo-random passwords)

Makepasswd generates pseudo-random passwords of a desired length.
It is able to generate its crypted equivalent.

Note: This SBo build was previously known as makepasswd. There is
now another (completely different) makepasswd utility on SBo, which
is named "makepasswd-debian". There is no conflict between the two,
but you may have to adjust the /usr/bin/makepasswd symlink to set the
default version your local scripts call, if you have both installed.
